bcoc:BusinessModelGovernance rdf:type skos:Concept .
bcoc:BusinessModelGovernance skos:definition "A business capability, inhering in an organization, that is realized in planned acts by which that organization keeps its business models current, reviewing them against feedback and changing conditions and revising the models in use; acts that first establish this oversight develop the capability and are not, on that ground alone, realizations of it."@en .
bcoc:BusinessModelGovernance skos:inScheme bcoc:CapabilityCatalogScheme .
bcoc:BusinessModelGovernance skos:prefLabel "Business Model Governance"@en .

