bcoc:TreasuryManagement skos:definition "A business capability, inhering in an organization, that is realized in planned acts by which that organization sets the scope and oversight of its treasury operations, tracks and reconciles its cash positions, fixes the policy for investing its funds, and formulates its strategy for hedging financial risk."@en .
